## Microglia correction approach (Path B per analysis_plan.md)
LM22 (CIBERSORTx) provides peripheral immune deconvolution. Brain-resident microglia are addressed via parallel ssGSEA scoring (already run, see ssGSEA_brain_immune_scores.tsv) using:
- Bohlen 2020 microglia core
- Butovsky 2014 microglia signature
- Klemm 2020 glioma-associated microglia
- Antunes 2021 Mg-TAM vs Mo-TAM
- Keren-Shaul 2017 DAM
- Plus MHC I/II, IFN response, MAPK activity, M1/M2 polarization (24 gene sets total)

Per reviewer_appeal_points.md Appeal #1, this dual approach lets us distinguish whether LM22 myeloid signal reflects resident microglia or peripheral monocyte-derived macrophages.
